
Method execution operations.
USAGE:

CALL <method name> [<actual paramlist>]
NOTE: <actual paramlist> ::= <actual param> | <actual param>,  <actual paramlist>

The following verb(s)/method(s) are available:

Call			[ In/Out ]Params&type			Status
====			=====================			======
Reboot                  [OUT]ReturnValue(uint32)            	Implemented    

SetDateTime             [IN ]LocalDateTime(DateTime)        	Implemented    

			[OUT]ReturnValue(uint32)            	

Shutdown                [OUT]ReturnValue(uint32)            	Implemented    

Win32Shutdown           [IN ]Flags(sint32)                  	Implemented    

			[IN ]Reserved(sint32)               	

			[OUT]ReturnValue(uint32)            	

Win32ShutdownTracker    [IN ]Comment(string)                	Implemented    

			[IN ]Flags(sint32)                  	

			[IN ]ReasonCode(uint32)             	

			[IN ]Timeout(uint32)                	

			[OUT]ReturnValue(uint32)            	


